; 判据：源串远超 1024 字节 —— 两次暂存拷贝若写在 `alloca i8, i64 1024` 上且 memcpy 无界，源串一长就砸栈
;   （自举 `makeScanner` 拿整份文件文本调用它）。权威 = 解释器的读数（2800 / 40）。
main|func() -> ():
    var s = ""
    var i = 0
    while i < 40:
        s = s + "0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ,,,,,,,,"
        i = i + 1
    print(len(s))
    let parts = s.split(",")
    print(len(parts))
    return
